WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:24.001
摄影师。
Photographer.

00:00:24.201 --> 00:00:27.501
你是来拍我的订婚的。
You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:29.201 --> 00:00:33.501
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.501
留下。
Stay.

00:00:37.863 --> 00:00:40.163
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:40.263 --> 00:00:45.063
你的气味。让我变成了这样。
Your scent. It did this to me.

00:00:45.263 --> 00:00:47.563
原来你在这里。
There you are.

00:00:47.763 --> 00:00:51.563
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:55.425 --> 00:00:57.725
你：和他一起上车
You: Get into the car with him

00:00:57.825 --> 00:01:02.625
很好，上车。
Good. Get in.

00:01:05.825 --> 00:01:09.625
你的气味现在在我身上。那家酒店里的每匹狼都会知道。
Your scent is on me now. Every wolf in that hotel will know.

00:01:09.825 --> 00:01:12.625
在我的庄园里，没人能碰你。
At my estate, no one can touch you.

00:01:12.987 --> 00:01:15.287
你：那“mate”到底是什么意思？全都告诉我。
You: So what does 'mate' actually mean? Tell me everything.

00:01:15.387 --> 00:01:20.187
一匹狼。一个Mate。没有别人。
One wolf. One Mate. There is no one else.

00:01:23.887 --> 00:01:28.187
现在，他们会来找你了。
They'll come looking for you now.

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:30.187
让他们来。
Let them.

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:32.849
你：一直给你打电话的是谁？是她吗？
You: Who keeps calling you? Is it her?

00:01:32.949 --> 00:01:37.749
Selene。婚约已经作废了。
Selene. The engagement is dead.

00:01:40.449 --> 00:01:42.749
这是我的领地。
This is my territory.

00:01:42.949 --> 00:01:46.249
这里到处都是我的气味。会冲到你的。
My scent is everywhere here. It'll hit you.

00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:50.411
你：跟着他走进起居室
You: Follow him into the living room

00:01:50.511 --> 00:01:55.311
会平静下来的。留在我身边。
It'll settle. Stay with me.

00:01:59.011 --> 00:02:02.311
这是我的领地。在这里没人能碰你。
This is my territory. No one touches you here.

00:02:02.511 --> 00:02:05.311
你本就不该被找到。
You were never meant to be found.

00:02:05.673 --> 00:02:07.973
你：那是谁？你在等人吗？
You: Who's that? Were you expecting someone?

00:02:08.073 --> 00:02:10.873
不，我没有在等人。
No. I wasn't expecting anyone.

00:02:11.073 --> 00:02:12.873
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:14.573 --> 00:02:18.373
Arkwright小姐，他今晚不见任何人。
Miss Arkwright, he's not receiving anyone tonight.

00:02:18.573 --> 00:02:20.873
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:23.235 --> 00:02:25.535
你：把手按在他的背上
You: Press your hand to his back

00:02:25.635 --> 00:02:30.435
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:31.635 --> 00:02:35.435
原来是真的。一个人类，Magnus？
So it's true. A human, Magnus?

00:02:35.635 --> 00:02:38.935
她不用你操心，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:02:40.797 --> 00:02:43.097
你：她说的满月是什么意思？看着我。
You: What did she mean by full moon? Look at me.

00:02:43.197 --> 00:02:44.997
看看你。好吧。我在看。
Look at you. Fine. I'm looking.

00:02:45.197 --> 00:02:47.997
满月之夜，长老会要什么就拿什么。
Full moon. The Council takes what it wants.

00:02:49.697 --> 00:02:52.997
我不会让他们得逞。
I won't let them.

00:02:53.197 --> 00:02:57.997
那你到底在怕什么？
Then what is it you're afraid of?

00:02:58.359 --> 00:03:00.659
你：牵起他的手，跟他走
You: Take his hand and go with him

00:03:07.259 --> 00:03:10.559
那他们会当面听到我的回答。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:03:10.759 --> 00:03:13.059
你留在我身边。
You stay beside me.

00:03:15.921 --> 00:03:18.221
你：我不害怕。我会留下，但不许再有秘密。
You: I'm not afraid. I'll stay, but no more secrets.

00:03:18.321 --> 00:03:23.121
不再有秘密。我发誓。
No more secrets. I swear it.

00:03:23.321 --> 00:03:27.621
我找了三十年。你本就不该被找到。
Thirty years I searched. You were never meant to be found.

00:03:30.321 --> 00:03:33.121
现在他们能听见我亲口说出来了。
Now they can hear me say it.

00:03:33.483 --> 00:03:35.783
你：接吧。但我要和你一起去。
You: Answer it. But I'm coming with you.

00:03:35.883 --> 00:03:40.683
是的。在我身边。
Yes. Beside me.

00:03:42.883 --> 00:03:46.183
把她交出来，Magnus。律法比你更古老。
Hand her over, Magnus. The law is older than you.

00:03:46.383 --> 00:03:49.683
那么律法今晚就此终结。她是我的Mate。
Then the law ends tonight. She is my Mate.
